# Default-deny: only the source inputs copied by the collectors Dockerfile enter
# the build context.
**
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!rust-toolchain.toml
!crates/
!crates/**
!nt/
!nt/**
!configs/
!configs/universes/
!configs/universes/**
!data-pipelines/
!data-pipelines/collectors/
!data-pipelines/collectors/**
!apps/
!apps/api-server/
!apps/api-server/auth/
!apps/api-server/auth/**
!tests/
!tests/integration/
!tests/integration/migration-contract/
!tests/integration/migration-contract/**
!tests/fixtures/
!tests/fixtures/kr-etf/
!tests/fixtures/kr-etf/contract/
!tests/fixtures/kr-etf/contract/**

# Security and generated-output deny rules override the allowlist above.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/.worktrees
**/.worktrees/**
**/target
**/target/**
**/.venv
**/.venv/**
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.env
**/credentials
**/credentials/**
**/secrets
**/secrets/**
**/raw
**/raw/**
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
